RED checks is labeled validation_failed (idempotent, the head SHA noted in a one-time comment) — validate-armed excludes the label and no validation CI is dispatched for it at all; the label is REMOVED only when the head's LAST committer is NOT 'sm-silent-update' (an author push), so the SM's own silent-updates never re-arm a red guest. Machine-authored PRs never get the label (fa pushes their heads).",
